decision=observed
identity=galaxy-quellcode-01
intent=G-03 an echten Software-Aufträgen prüfen: Senkt ein angenommenes Ergebnis eines Auftrags die Kosten eines anderen Auftrags?
scope=Two queued jobs per arm on the live service, same pinned gate with held-out records, same worker (claude-opus-5-5, medium effort, no tools), alternating order.
producer=../job-factory-neomorph/round-01.run (highlightRun, accepted by its own gate and running in the viewer)
consumer_without=../job-protokoll-leser-ohne-1/round-01.run, ../job-protokoll-leser-ohne-2/round-01.run
consumer_with=../job-protokoll-leser-mit-1/round-01.run, ../job-protokoll-leser-mit-2/round-01.run
exchange=The retained operator was added to the brief as text, 1810 bytes. No other difference between the arms.
transfer=The unchanged retained operator passed the held-out gate in a local self-check before the experiment. A deliberately broken copy failed it.
accepted_without=2 of 2 in round 1
accepted_with=2 of 2 in round 1
output_tokens_without=4760, 4315
output_tokens_with=5907, 4958
cost_usd_without=0.110, 0.090
cost_usd_with=0.140, 0.103
worker_ms_without=76623, 54444
worker_ms_with=64378, 79122
reuse=Both reuse runs adapted the operator. Text similarity to the retained block 0.56 and 0.33, against 0.18 and 0.17 without it.
observation=No benefit. Both arms were accepted in the first round. Mean cost with reuse was higher (0.122 against 0.100 USD) and so was mean worker time (71.8 s against 65.5 s). With two runs per arm the difference is within the spread of single runs.
interpretation=The worker solves this task from the brief alone, so the retained operator had nothing to save. A benefit could only show on a task the worker fails or repairs without the retained result.
g01=Shown again in the source domain: two consumers used a result of another composition.
g02=Not exercised here.
g03=Not supported for this task. Round 9 of job-rust-entrypoint shows a measured benefit of reusing a retained observation inside the service (239.8 ms -> 50.2 ms with 2000 archived jobs), written by an external agent.
i01=Not shown. Every learning rule in the system so far was written by an external agent.
i02=Weak support: the retained operator passed records it was not gated on. One operator, one held-out sample.
i03=Not supported for this task. The reuse arm cost more.
unperformed=No task was tried that the worker fails without reuse. No statistics beyond two runs per arm. Three of four gate runs took about 3 s and one took 59 ms with the same gate. The cause is not measured.
continuation=Find a task class where unattended rounds are rejected or repaired, from the Factory's own records, before testing reuse again. Measure the gate run time spread first, because it is 40 times the fastest run.
end
